ko'a lo mlana lo kilgarna". I knew this was wrong, as I have jbofi'e running 
and there is no x2 of "tunta", but vlasisku and jbovlaste were both down and I 
couldn't check the other words. Now they're back up, but I still don't know 
how to say it.
* "katna" doesn't apply, as no pieces result.
* "tunda'i" (which I'm going to use unless you can come up with something 
better) doesn't imply a resulting hole.
* Why do "tikpa" and "darxi" have x3 and x4 switched from each other?

